; The jsonschema deriver is shared between the native and browser ppx (it is
; platform-agnostic: it only emits references to Jsonkit.Jsonschema and to
; unqualified <prim>_jsonschema values).
; Like the common modules above, the sources are copied in rather than shared via
; a library, so the deriver ships inside jsonkit.ppx with no extra package.

(copy_files#
 (files ../jsonschema/{schema.ml,schema.mli,ppx_deriving_jsonschema.ml}))

